    "delegateArgumentHash": "Attribute-delegate argument hashes (Field_360b6c38) are djb2-xor, seed 5381, over the case-sensitive argument name. Verified for 14 of 14 named arguments in the Control, Control1, Hipfire and Mobility delegates.",
