    "labelTest": "Each label was tested as PascalCase, lowercase and camelCase with djb2-xor, FNV-1 and FNV-1a. No result matched any of 58,247 distinct hashes in GRX_Weapons.xml or 518 Field_ hashes cited in docs, scripts, data and provenance.",
    "textMatches": "Three labels match a known readable argument name. The djb2-xor hash of that name is given. These are name correspondences, not a binding found in the game data."
